{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 12455,
	"Name": "Invisible Things for Alternative Textures (AT)",
	"Author": "lydocia",
	"Description": "[size=3][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hdr_description.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />I needed a way to keep the tiles in between my trees in my tree farm from getting seeds and grown new trees.\n<br />\n<br />I could've gone with either paths or decoration items, or maybe rocks or plants from the\u00A0[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12453/]Dungeon Clutter[/url][/b]\u00A0mod.\n<br />\n<br />But I wanted... nothing. Grass. Just a \"DO NOT SPAWN STUFF HERE PLS\" bit of grass.\n<br />\n<br />Thanks to\u00A0[b]o0MrPro\u00A0[/b]in the comments, I realised this concept was applicable to more than just paths.\n<br />You could hide the paths and chests in your [b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1063]Automate[/url][/b] set-up. Hide your sprinklers and scarecrows for a less industrial feel.\n<br />\n<br />The perfect mod for when you have stuff to hide.\n<br />\n<br />P.S. I need to do a little shout-out here: the Slime cave you see in many of my screenshots is from the\u00A0[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2716]Slime Hutch Natural Interior[/url][/b]\u00A0mod.\u00A0\n<br />I absolutely adore this mod (I don't know what the devs were thinking with that industrial looking purple building that pokes your eyes out).\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hr.png[/img]\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hdr_install.png[/img]\n<br />[/size][list=1]\n<br />[size=3]\n<br />\n<br />1. Install\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400]SMAPI[/url]\n<br />2. Install\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternative Textures[/url]\n<br />3. Download the .zip file and extract into your\u00A0/Mods\u00A0folder\n<br />\n<br />There are multiple .zip files in the Files tab, download the ones you want (or download the -one labelled \"ALL\" if you want them all!)\n<br />\n<br />[/size][/list][size=3][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hr.png[/img]\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hdr_use.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />Recolour the items using the\u00A0[b][url=https://github.com/Floogen/AlternativeTextures/wiki/Paint-Bucket-Tool]Paint Bucket[/url]\uFEFF[/b], or use the\u00A0[b][url=https://github.com/Floogen/AlternativeTextures/wiki/Paint-Brush-Tool]Paint Brush[/url]\uFEFF[/b]\u00A0to copy / paste textures.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Note:[/b]\u00A0it is your responsibility to remember where your invisible items are!\n<br />You can always colour them back if you know where to aim your paint bucket.\n<br />If all else fails, uninstalling the mod will turn your objects visible again.\n<br />\n<br />I also advise using\u00A0[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/518]Chests Anywhere[/url][/b]\u00A0if you are going to hide your chests.\n<br />It's not required, of course, but it makes it a lot easier to access them.\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hr.png[/img]\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hdr_bugreports.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />If you have any\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternative Textures[/url]-specific issues, please direct them to the devs on their respective mod page.\uFEFF\n<br />\n<br />Please report any other issues you may find in the 'Bugs' tab (as I might miss them in the general posts tab).\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hr.png[/img]\n<br />\u00A0\u00A0[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hdr_credits.png[/img]\n<br />\uFEFF\n<br />There was absolutely no effort involved in the creation of this mod whatsoever.\n<br />Still, though, please do not re-use or re-share anywhere without my permission\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_hr.png[/img]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/users/11157158?tab=user+files][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_banner.png[/img][/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[url=https://discord.gg/ZPcuC3B][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_button1.png[/img][/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[url=https://www.lydocia.com/][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_button2.png[/img][/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[url=https://www.buymeacoffee.com/lydocia][img]https://www.lydocia.com/mods/stardewvalley/img/_button3.png[/img][/url][/size]",
